<title>UK: UK refers Carlton-Metrocolor tie-up to MMC.</title>
<headline>UK refers Carlton-Metrocolor tie-up to MMC.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>British regulators said on Thursday they had referred Carlton Communications Plc's planned acquisition of a Time Warner Inc unit to the Monopolies and Mergers Commission for a competition review.</p>
<p>John Taylor, Minister for Corporate and Consumer Affairs, said the proposed acquisition of Metrocolor London Ltd by Carlton's Technicolor Ltd unit raised concerns related to the processing and printing of motion picture film in Britain.  </p>
<p>The MMC were required to make their report by June 25, Taylor said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
